            "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/514660/extras/a92b8572c8fe37bf9eba5a940832ffee.avif?t=1760395989\" width=616 height=108 /></span><br>BitMaster is a dynamic and colorful twin-stick shooter which design was inspired by such games as Geometry Wars, Crimson Land and Satellite Reign. Game powered by Unreal Engine 4!<br><br>You need to destroy the enemies and collect power-ups to improve weapons. Game balance changes periodically, which makes the game unpredictable and difficult to get a high score.<br><br>BitMaster is suitable for all ages. Average game session is half an hour long.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>100 waves of enemies<br></li><li>8 guns<br></li><li>13 perks<br></li><li>5 heroes to unlock<br></li><li>20 types of enemies<br></li><li>5 wicked bosses<br></li><li>Only 1 way to escape<br></li><li>Lot of factors that may cause troubles... or make the game easier!</li></ul>",
